---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../site';
---

<PageLayout
  title="Disclosure"
  eyebrow="Site information"
  description={`How ${SITE.name} uses advertising, affiliate links, and licensed illustrative images across its guides.`}
  lede="How commercial links and illustrative images appear here."
>
  <h2>Affiliate links</h2>
  <p>As an Amazon Associate we earn from qualifying purchases. Some articles contain affiliate links. If you buy through one, this site may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. A disclosure appears immediately before product recommendations. Prices and availability are set by the retailer and may change. A recommendation is not a claim that the publication bought, reviewed or tested the product.</p>

  <h2>Advertising</h2>
  <p>This site is a Google AdSense publisher, and the AdSense script loads on every page. No ad slots are hand-placed inside the articles, and none are placed on the utility screens — search, topic listings, saved ideas and error pages. Advertising is kept separate from editorial judgement: no advertiser pays for coverage, a mention here is never sold, and the <a href="/privacy-policy/">privacy policy</a> explains the cookies advertising sets and how to opt out of personalised ads.</p>

  <h2>Photography</h2>
  <p>Articles may use stock images from Unsplash, Pexels, or other licensed sources. Where a source credit is available it appears with the image. Stock images illustrate an idea; they are not evidence that we built or tested the pictured room or product. If you believe an image is credited incorrectly, <a href="/contact/">send us the page URL</a>.</p>

  <h2>Questions</h2>
  <p>For questions about a recommendation or disclosure, email <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>.</p>
</PageLayout>
